  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Offshore wind KWEIA NL government lounge</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports the organisation of a Netherlands government pavilion at the Offshore Wind Supply Chain Conference and Exhibition on 2-3 July 2025 in Busan, South Korea.The event is South Korea&apos;s main offshore wind trade fair and brings together key players from across the sector. The pavilion will showcase Dutch expertise and facilitate engagement with Korean stakeholders.With South Korea rapidly expanding offshore wind capacity, the event provides opportunities for knowledge exchange and partnership development. It supports dialogue between governments and businesses and strengthens cooperation between the Netherlands and South Korea in offshore wind development.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country is mentioned in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
